<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ALEX. BROWN CUTS SITEL.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ALEX. BROWN CUTS SITEL.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it downgraded SITEL Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- On Wednesday, SITEL posted second quarter operating earnings of $0.10 a share compared with $0.06 percent on an 81 percent increase in revenues.</p>
<p>-- Shares of SITEL were indicated to open lower in the range of eight to 9-1/2, compared with Wednesday's closing price of 15-4/16.</p>
</text>
